{
    "title": "Supermarket Master Simulator",
    "description": "\u2b50\ufe0f Welcome to Supermarket Master Simulator, the ultimate shop management game where you'll dive into the world of grocery store operations and learn how to effectively run your own supermarket.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb5 Check out the customers by scanning their items and processing their payments with either cash or credit card. \r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Ensure accuracy to avoid scanning incorrect items or giving wrong change, as mistakes can frustrate customers. \r\n\ud83d\udc8e Accumulate funds to purchase additional product packs, which will help draw in more shoppers. \r\n\ud83d\udcc8 Keep enhancing your store and managing your supermarket to grow your business.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49Are you ready to become \"Master Cashier\"? Download Supermarket Master Simulator now and embark on your journey to becoming a Professional Cashier.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2b50\ufe0f Welcome to Supermarket Master Simulator, the ultimate shop management game where you&#39;ll dive into the world of grocery store operations and learn how to effectively run your own supermarket.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\ud83d\udcb5 Check out the customers by scanning their items and processing their payments with either cash or credit card. <br>\ud83d\udcb0 Ensure accuracy to avoid scanning incorrect items or giving wrong change, as mistakes can frustrate customers. <br>\ud83d\udc8e Accumulate funds to purchase additional product packs, which will help draw in more shoppers. <br>\ud83d\udcc8 Keep enhancing your store and managing your supermarket to grow your business.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49Are you ready to become &quot;Master Cashier&quot;? Download Supermarket Master Simulator now and embark on your journey to becoming a Professional Cashier.",
